Trademarks & non-affiliation
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Cellar is an independent, community project. It is NOT affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by any of the following, and all trademarks are the
property of their respective owners:

  - Apple Inc.  (macOS, Metal, Game Porting Toolkit, D3DMetal, Rosetta)
  - Valve Corporation  (Steam, Steam Play, Proton)
  - Blizzard Entertainment, Inc.  (Battle.net, Diablo)
  - CD PROJEKT S.A.  (GOG, GOG Galaxy)
  - CodeWeavers Inc.  (CrossOver)
  - Frontier Developments plc  (Planet Coaster, COBRA engine)
  - The Wine Project, the Khronos Group, and other upstream projects

Product and game names are used only descriptively (nominative use) to state
what Cellar is compatible with.

Cellar's interface shows a small mark beside each game to say which storefront
it came from. Cellar bundles, redistributes and downloads no third-party logo
file. Where the storefront is already installed on the machine, Cellar displays
that installation's own icon, read from the user's own copy; where it is not,
Cellar draws a simplified shape in its own code
(Sources/CellarUI/StoreMark.swift). Either way the mark is used nominatively --
to label where a game came from -- not to suggest endorsement or affiliation.

