Important
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Cellar does not bundle or redistribute Apple's proprietary D3DMetal / Game
Porting Toolkit. It reaches the user's Mac inside a community Wine runner that
Cellar downloads at run time, or from Apple's own Game Porting Toolkit, under
Apple's license, which permits only non-commercial use and distribution.

Cellar never circumvents DRM or anti-cheat, and is intended only for use with
games you legally own.

See THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md for the licenses of components Cellar uses or
bundles, and docs/LEGAL.md for the project's compliance rules.
